						 <p>Good idea, but it needs to be written differently. For instance, &quot;SCP - 5179 is to be contained in a container which is made of bismuth metal sheeting on all surfaces.&quot; Change repetitive statements like 'contained in a container' and find new, less redundant ways of expressing your ideas. Check out some of the other SCPs and check out how the authors wrote their articles. It might be a good idea to take notes on how they write their articles to see how you can redo this article for the better.</p> 
